### User API Tests ###

### Create User
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "name": "Test User"
}

### Create User - Invalid Email
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "invalid-email",
  "name": "Test User"
}

### Create User - Missing Required Field
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User"
}

### Get All Users
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users

### Get User by Email
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users?email=test@example.com

### Create Duplicate User (to test unique constraint)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "name": "Another User"
}